*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Prof. Owlbrowley]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
