**3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
**5 [[Prof. Owlbrowley]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
